  simctl_vpi.c, simctl_forksave.c, simctl_describe.c, simctl_mem.c, simctl_apply.c and
    simctl_push.c (one unit: simctl_vpi.c includes the others), and the libsimctl.so built from them;
  simctl_stub.c, and the libsimctl_stub.so built from it (installed in ~/.cache/cmux/simctl);
  simctl_saver.sv (the fork-save top), simctl_tb.sv (simctl_cfg, simctl_port) and simctl_hold.sv
    (the apply hold): testbench pieces a design is built with;
  tb.js (the worker's testbench helper) and simctl-manifest.js (the build-manifest tool).

